## 7.1 Ground-truth methodology

Use the existing:

`ground-truth.json`

or the equivalent ground-truth file found in the project.

The ground-truth dataset must be used only by evaluation logic.

It must never be passed into the production detection engine as an input.

Calculate:

```text
Precision =
True Positives / (True Positives + False Positives)

Recall =
True Positives / (True Positives + False Negatives)

F1 Score =
2 × Precision × Recall / (Precision + Recall)
```

